        <li><a href="https://rockfordil.legistar.com/LegislationDetail.aspx?GUID=3A458DD2-D27E-4632-8258-4CFE1375A353&ID=8144597&Options=&Search=">Rockford — FY2027 Organized Retail Crime grant action</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">UNRESOLVED</p>
    <h2>Not established by the published records.</h2>
    <ul class="about_questions">
      <li>Winnebago County's complete current ALPR inventory, locations, retention configuration, sharing settings, authorized-user count, and audit results.</li>
      <li>Rockford's current ALPR inventory divided among fixed, mobile, and Flock-operated devices.</li>
      <li>The vendor, policy, retention rules, and alert-review process for Rockford's gunshot-detection system.</li>
      <li>The vendor, product, query rules, data sources, and retention rules for Rockford's social-media analytics.</li>
      <li>Complete current drone inventories, payloads, policies, and flight records for the Sheriff's Office and Rockford Police.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>
